---
title: Mobility packs
---

A mobility pack adds a list of **stretching / mobility drills** to the Mobility
block's drill catalogue. Like exercise packs it's pure JSON — no code, no sandbox
— so it installs regardless of Restricted Mode.

## The pack file

```json
{
  "formatVersion": 1,
  "pluginId": "com.you.hip-pack",
  "drills": [
    {
      "name": "Couch Stretch",
      "area": "hip-flexors",
      "defaultMetric": "hold",
      "perSide": true,
      "cues": ["Rear shin against the wall", "Squeeze the glute"]
    },
    {
      "name": "Banded Hip Raise",
      "area": "hip-flexors",
      "defaultMetric": "reps",
      "perSide": true,
      "notes": "Active end-range hip flexion."
    }
  ]
}
```

- **`area`** must be from: `neck`, `shoulders`, `t-spine`, `lower-back`,
  `wrists`, `hips`, `hip-flexors`, `glutes`, `hamstrings`, `quads`, `adductors`,
  `calves`, `ankles`, `full-body`.
- **`defaultMetric`** (optional, default `hold`): `hold` or `reps` — the metric
  the block starts with when the user picks this drill.
- **`perSide`** (optional, default `false`): whether the drill is logged left /
  right separately.
- **`cues`** (optional): up to 6 short coaching lines.
- Max 500 drills. In-pack duplicate names are dropped.

## The manifest

```json
{
  "id": "com.you.hip-pack",
  "family": "mobility-pack",
  "name": "Hip Pack",
  "description": "Hip prehab drills.",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "author": "You",
  "integrity": "sha256-…",
  "distribution": {
    "origin": "url",
    "manifestUrl": "plugins/hip-pack/manifest.json",
    "bundleUrl": "plugins/hip-pack/drills.json"
  },
  "capabilities": [
    { "family": "mobility-pack", "mobilityPackId": "com.you.hip-pack" }
  ]
}
```

`capabilities[0].mobilityPackId` must equal the manifest `id`.

## What happens on install

Pack drills appear in the Mobility block's drill picker with namespaced ids
(`pack:<id>:<slug>`). A built-in drill with the same name wins. Disabling or
uninstalling the pack removes them cleanly. Pack contents are device-local — not
synced. Sample: `static/sample-plugins/hip-rehab-pack`.

Next: [publishing](/docs/plugins/publishing).
